💡 Which Linkage Should I Use?
Use Case	Recommended Linkage
Noisy data	Average / Ward
Elongated, uneven shapes	Single
Spherical, compact clusters	Complete / Ward
Fast computation needed	Single
Want to reduce variance	Ward

